   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The imperative",
     "texto": [
      "To give orders or instructions, use the present form without the pronoun. With **tu**, you drop the **-s** of **-er** verbs: **Tu écoutes** → **Écoute !** (listen!).",
      "With **vous** and **nous** you don't remove anything: **Parlez !** (speak!), **Mangeons !** (let's eat!)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Common verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Va** (go), **allez** (go; plural), **allons** (let's go).",
      "**Sois** (be), **soyez** (be; plural).",
      "**Aie** (have), **ayez** (have; plural)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Negative",
     "texto": [
      "**Ne** and **pas** go around the verb: **Ne parle pas !** (don't speak!), **Ne mangez pas !** (don't eat!)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
